    "turn_text": "much for joining me today. So one of the things that I so enjoyed in preparing for the program was reading your time to wake up addresses on climate change to your colleagues in the Congress. Give us a thumbnail of sort of how that whole program of yours started and how long you've been doing it and why and just kind of the general reception you get for doing it.",
