  {
    "episode_id": 42503,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/2/42503.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think it's safe to say as we're approaching the end of the Obama administration, he really was so hamstrung trying to get movement forward on health care law that, you know, expending political capital on environmental issues was probably just a non-starter for him. I mean, I'll do anything to defend President Obama.",
