      },
      {
        "text": "Private funding for legitimate R&D should be encouraged because it drives innovation.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a third category of scientific research that is fraudulent.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "This fraudulent science is intentionally created to undermine real science on public health and safety.",
